      "values": {
        "Title": "At School",
        "Content": "My school starts at eight in the morning. We study English and maths in the first lessons. My teacher is kind and helpful. She explains new words slowly so we can understand them well. I write notes in my notebook every day.\n\nAt lunch I sit with my friends in the yard. We talk about our hobbies and share fruit from home. In the afternoon we have art class. I draw pictures of my family and feel happy when the teacher smiles at my work. School ends at four.",
